{"title": "Beholder Iris", "pageid": 14568, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Beholder_Iris", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Beholder_Iris_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Beholder_Iris_Icon.png/300px-Beholder_Iris_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f0/Beholder_Iris_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Beholder Iris image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Beholder_Iris_Icon.png/300px-Beholder_Iris_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Beholder_Iris_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Beholder Iris</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to create a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye\" title=\"Essence of Beholder Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Beholder_Eye\" title=\"Essence of Beholder Eye\">Essence of Beholder Eye</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\">Supreme Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/image